@startuml
[*] --> NotLoggedIn
NotLoggedIn --> Login : User attempts to login
NotLoggedIn --> ProfileCreation : User creates new profile
Login --> LoggedIn : Authentication successful
LoggedIn --> ViewProfile : View profile
LoggedIn --> EditProfile : Edit profile
LoggedIn --> TrackProgress : Track progress
LoggedIn --> Logout : Logout
TrackProgress --> ViewProfile : View progress
EditProfile --> ViewProfile : Save changes
Logout --> [*] : Logout successful
ProfileCreation --> [*] : Profile creation failed
ProfileCreation --> NotLoggedIn : Profile creation successful
@enduml
